` as the reviewer, but the PR came back with no reviewers attached. I don't know the code owners' handles, so I couldn't request review directly.\n\n**To ship in today's release:** a code owner needs to review and approve PR #101, after which it can be merged. If you give me the code owner's handle, I can request their review. Once they've approved, I can merge it.", "type": "text"}]}]}